  "body": "# Pulse Music v4.1.5 - In-App Telemetry & Real-Time Performance Analytics\n\nOfficial multi-platform release and global OTA update for **Android**, **Windows**, **Orion Store**, **F-Droid**, **Obtainium**, and **Web**.\n\n---\n\n### 📡 In-App Live Telemetry & Zero-PII Performance Analytics\n- **Live App Insights**: Telemetry integration that records song playback completions, search query trends, stream latency, and active session health.\n- **Strict Privacy Guarantee**: 100% Zero-PII — no personal names, email addresses, exact IP addresses, or credentials are ever collected or stored.\n- **Private Owner Telemetry**: Real-time stats stream securely to the owner-protected dashboard (`owner-telemetry.html`).\n\n### ⚡ Real-Time Live Download Tracking & GitHub Sync\n- Verified real-time GitHub release counter synchronized directly via GitHub APIs with zero synthetic data.\n\n### 🎵 Audio Engine Refinements\n- Continued optimization of 32-bit float PCM audio pipeline and FLAC stream metadata detection.\n",
